{"seq":1,"slug":"multipart-upload-protocols","title":"Multipart 上传协议与实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/multipart-upload-protocols","wordCount":1356,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"multipart-上传协议与实现\">Multipart 上传协议与实现</h1><p>RFC 2046 定义的 <code>multipart/form-data</code> 编码格式经历了三十年的工程实践，至今仍是浏览器原生表单提交二进制数据的唯一标准化途径。理解其报文结构是所有上传功能开发的起点——无论后续是否引入分片续传或客户端直传，服务端解析 multipart boundary 的能力都不可省略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Boundary</strong>：由客户端生成、在 Content-Type 中声明的分隔字符串，用于在请求体中划分各个 part</li>\n<li><strong>Part</strong>：multipart 请求中的一个独立数据段，含自身的 header（Content-Disposition、Content-Type）和 body</li>\n<li><strong>流式解析</strong>：逐 chunk 扫描 boundary 模式并触发回调，内存占用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(bufferSize)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(fileSize)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>大小限制分层</strong>：从负载均衡到反向代理到框架到解析器的多级限制，实现快速拒绝</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"协议报文结构\">协议报文结构</h2><p>一个 multipart 请求的核心在于 <strong>boundary</strong> 分隔符。客户端在 <code>Content-Type</code> 头中声明 boundary 值，服务端据此切割请求体中的多个 part。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"POST /api/files HTTP/1.1&#10;Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW&#10;Content-Length: 48763&#10;&#10;------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW&#10;Content-Disposition: form-data; name=&quot;metadata&quot;&#10;Content-Type: application/json&#10;&#10;{&quot;category&quot;:&quot;avatar&quot;,&quot;userId&quot;:&quot;u_3721&quot;}&#10;------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW&#10;Content-Disposition: form-data; name=&quot;file&quot;; filename=&quot;profile.png&quot;&#10;Content-Type: image/png&#10;&#10;&lt;binary data&gt;&#10;------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>POST /api/files HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Length: 48763</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"metadata\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{\"category\":\"avatar\",\"userId\":\"u_3721\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"file\"; filename=\"profile.png\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: image/png</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;binary data></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个 part 拥有独立的 header 区与 body 区，由 <code>\\r\\n\\r\\n</code> 分隔。末尾 boundary 追加 <code>--</code> 表示请求体结束。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成部分</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Boundary 行</td>\n<td>分隔各 part</td>\n<td>不能出现在 part body 中；长度 ≤70 字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Disposition</td>\n<td>声明字段名与文件名</td>\n<td><code>name</code> 必选；文件类 part 含 <code>filename</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Type（per-part）</td>\n<td>标识 part MIME 类型</td>\n<td>缺省时按 <code>application/octet-stream</code> 处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content-Transfer-Encoding</td>\n<td>编码方式</td>\n<td>HTTP 场景几乎总是 binary（非 base64）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"服务端解析策略\">服务端解析策略</h2><p>生产级解析器需要处理两个核心挑战：<strong>内存控制</strong> 与 <strong>boundary 注入防御</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"流式解析-vs-缓冲解析\">流式解析 vs 缓冲解析</h3><p>缓冲解析将整个请求体读入内存后按 boundary 切割——实现简单但对大文件不可用。流式解析器逐 chunk 扫描 boundary 模式，命中时触发 part 回调：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Readable } from &#39;node:stream&#39;;&#10;import { createWriteStream } from &#39;node:fs&#39;;&#10;import Busboy from &#39;busboy&#39;;&#10;&#10;function handleUpload(req: IncomingMessage): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {&#10;    const bb = Busboy({&#10;      headers: req.headers,&#10;      limits: { fileSize: 50 * 1024 * 1024 }, // 50 MB&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    bb.on(&#39;file&#39;, (fieldname, stream, info) =&gt; {&#10;      const savePath = `/tmp/uploads/${info.filename}`;&#10;      const ws = createWriteStream(savePath);&#10;      stream.pipe(ws);&#10;      stream.on(&#39;limit&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;        ws.destroy();&#10;        reject(new Error(&#39;FILE_TOO_LARGE&#39;));&#10;      });&#10;      ws.on(&#39;finish&#39;, () =&gt; resolve(savePath));&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    bb.on(&#39;error&#39;, reject);&#10;    req.pipe(bb);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Readable } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:stream'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createWriteStream } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Busboy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'busboy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleUpload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IncomingMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Busboy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      headers: req.headers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      limits: { fileSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 50 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fieldname</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> savePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `/tmp/uploads/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">info</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">filename</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createWriteStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(savePath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ws);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      stream.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'limit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">destroy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FILE_TOO_LARGE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ws.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'finish'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(savePath));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    req.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bb);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>流式解析器的关键属性：内存占用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(bufferSize)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(fileSize)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，使得同一进程可并发处理数百个上传请求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常用解析库对比\">常用解析库对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言/运行时</th>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>流式支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>Busboy</td>\n<td>轻量、零依赖、事件驱动</td>\n<td>完全流式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td>Multer（基于 Busboy）</td>\n<td>Express 中间件封装</td>\n<td>流式（可落盘/内存）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td><code>mime/multipart</code> 标准库</td>\n<td>Reader 逐 part 返回 io.Reader</td>\n<td>完全流式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>Apache Commons FileUpload 2.x</td>\n<td>Streaming API</td>\n<td>流式（需显式选用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>multer crate</td>\n<td>基于 tokio AsyncRead</td>\n<td>异步流式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"请求体大小限制的分层设计\">请求体大小限制的分层设计</h2><p>生产系统中，大小限制需要在多个层级协同生效：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt;|Content-Length 预检| B[负载均衡器]&#10;    B --&gt;|client_max_body_size| C[反向代理 Nginx]&#10;    C --&gt;|框架级 bodyLimit| D[应用服务器]&#10;    D --&gt;|解析器 limits.fileSize| E[Multipart 解析器]&#10;    E --&gt;|写入| F[临时存储]\">graph TD\n    A[客户端] --&gt;|Content-Length 预检| B[负载均衡器]\n    B --&gt;|client_max_body_size| C[反向代理 Nginx]\n    C --&gt;|框架级 bodyLimit| D[应用服务器]\n    D --&gt;|解析器 limits.fileSize| E[Multipart 解析器]\n    E --&gt;|写入| F[临时存储]</pre><p>分层限制的优势在于<strong>快速拒绝</strong>：在最外层就可以通过 <code>Content-Length</code> 做早期判断，避免浪费带宽传输注定被拒绝的数据。但注意 <code>Content-Length</code> 可被伪造，因此内层的字节计数仍不可省略。</p>\n<p>典型配置示例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>推荐值（一般业务）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Nginx</td>\n<td><code>client_max_body_size</code></td>\n<td>100m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js Fastify</td>\n<td><code>bodyLimit</code></td>\n<td>104857600</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Busboy</td>\n<td><code>limits.fileSize</code></td>\n<td>52428800（50MB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3 单次 PUT</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>5GB（AWS 硬限）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多文件与混合表单处理\">多文件与混合表单处理</h2><p>实际业务场景中，单次 multipart 请求往往混合文本字段与多个文件字段。服务端需要在流式解析过程中区分字段类型并路由到不同处理逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func handleMultipart(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {&#10;    reader, err := r.MultipartReader()&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        http.Error(w, &quot;invalid multipart&quot;, http.StatusBadRequest)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;    for {&#10;        part, err := reader.NextPart()&#10;        if err == io.EOF {&#10;            break&#10;        }&#10;        if part.FileName() != &quot;&quot; {&#10;            // 文件 part：流式写入临时文件&#10;            dst, _ := os.CreateTemp(&quot;&quot;, &quot;upload-*&quot;)&#10;            io.Copy(dst, part)&#10;            dst.Close()&#10;        } else {&#10;            // 文本字段：读入内存（限制长度）&#10;            data, _ := io.ReadAll(io.LimitReader(part, 1&lt;&lt;20))&#10;            processField(part.FormName(), string(data))&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleMultipart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ResponseWriter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reader, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MultipartReader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"invalid multipart\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, http.StatusBadRequest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        part, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NextPart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io.EOF {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> part.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FileName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 文件 part：流式写入临时文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            dst, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CreateTemp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"upload-*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Copy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dst, part)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            dst.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 文本字段：读入内存（限制长度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            data, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LimitReader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(part, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            processField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(part.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FormName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"content-type-验证与-mime-嗅探\">Content-Type 验证与 MIME 嗅探</h2><p>客户端声明的 <code>Content-Type</code> 不可信赖。攻击者可以将 <code>.exe</code> 文件伪装为 <code>image/png</code> 上传。服务端必须基于文件内容的 <strong>magic bytes</strong>（文件头签名）做二次校验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件类型</th>\n<th>Magic Bytes（hex）</th>\n<th>偏移</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PNG</td>\n<td><code>89 50 4E 47 0D 0A 1A 0A</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JPEG</td>\n<td><code>FF D8 FF</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PDF</td>\n<td><code>25 50 44 46</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZIP</td>\n<td><code>50 4B 03 04</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GIF</td>\n<td><code>47 49 46 38</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>流式解析器可以在读取文件 part 的前几个字节后立即执行 magic bytes 比对，不匹配则提前终止 part 读取并返回 400 错误——避免为非法文件消耗后续 I/O。</p>\n<p>更多关于上传安全检查的深入讨论，参见 <a href=\"../security-reliability/upload-validation-scanning\">上传校验与病毒扫描</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化实践\">性能优化实践</h2><h3 id=\"并发-part-写入\">并发 Part 写入</h3><p>当单请求包含多个文件时，可以将各 part 的写入操作并发化。但需注意保持总并发数受控，避免磁盘 I/O 队列爆满：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const MAX_CONCURRENT_WRITES = 4;&#10;const semaphore = new Semaphore(MAX_CONCURRENT_WRITES);&#10;&#10;bb.on(&#39;file&#39;, async (field, stream, info) =&gt; {&#10;  await semaphore.acquire();&#10;  try {&#10;    await pipeline(stream, createWriteStream(targetPath));&#10;  } finally {&#10;    semaphore.release();&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_CONCURRENT_WRITES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> semaphore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Semaphore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MAX_CONCURRENT_WRITES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'file'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> semaphore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stream, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createWriteStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(targetPath));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    semaphore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"零拷贝转发\">零拷贝转发</h3><p>如果上传文件的最终目的地是对象存储，中间服务器无需将文件完整落盘。可以通过 pipe 将 part stream 直接转发到 S3 PutObject 的请求体中，实现<strong>零落盘转发</strong>。这种模式在 <a href=\"presigned-url-direct-upload\">预签名 URL 与客户端直传</a> 中会进一步讨论其架构替代方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理与客户端重试\">错误处理与客户端重试</h2><p>Multipart 上传是原子操作——要么全部成功，要么全部失败。当服务端在解析中途检测到错误（文件过大、类型非法、磁盘满），应立即：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>销毁已建立的写入流</li>\n<li>清理已写入的临时文件</li>\n<li>返回明确的错误响应（状态码 + 错误码 + 人可读消息）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>客户端收到错误后只能重传整个请求——这正是 Multipart 模式在大文件场景下的根本缺陷。对于需要断点恢复能力的场景，应切换到 <a href=\"chunked-resumable-upload\">分片与断点续传</a> 方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Multipart 表单上传是 Web 生态中最基础的文件传输协议。其核心工程要点在于：使用流式解析器控制内存占用、通过多层大小限制实现快速拒绝、基于 magic bytes 而非客户端声明做类型验证。该模式的原子性缺陷（失败必须重传全部）决定了它只适合中小文件——大文件场景需要分片续传或预签名直传架构。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Multipart 上传协议与实现","id":"multipart-上传协议与实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协议报文结构","id":"协议报文结构"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端解析策略","id":"服务端解析策略"},{"level":3,"text":"流式解析 vs 缓冲解析","id":"流式解析-vs-缓冲解析"},{"level":3,"text":"常用解析库对比","id":"常用解析库对比"},{"level":2,"text":"请求体大小限制的分层设计","id":"请求体大小限制的分层设计"},{"level":2,"text":"多文件与混合表单处理","id":"多文件与混合表单处理"},{"level":2,"text":"Content-Type 验证与 MIME 嗅探","id":"content-type-验证与-mime-嗅探"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化实践","id":"性能优化实践"},{"level":3,"text":"并发 Part 写入","id":"并发-part-写入"},{"level":3,"text":"零拷贝转发","id":"零拷贝转发"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理与客户端重试","id":"错误处理与客户端重试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"分片与断点续传","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/chunked-resumable-upload"}}